    "text": {
     "en": "A merchant is a person who buys and sells things. A perch is a bar or branch where a bird sits.\nTender means soft and easy to chew, like tender fruits. A windowsill is the ledge at the bottom of a window.\nDistressed means very sad or upset. Sighed means let out a long breath to show feelings like sadness.\nCollective nouns and phrases from the lesson such as flight of parrots and came across extend the vocabulary.\nUse each new word in a sentence of your own."
    }
